<title>HONG KONG: Citibank sets warrants on Hongkong Land.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Hongkong Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank, N.A., Hong Kong Branch, said on Tuesday it has issued 130 million American call warrants on Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$2.421	   PREMIUM	 13.45 PCT</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    US$2.69	    GEARING	 4.26X</p>
<p> MATURITY	    20.MAY.98	  LISTING DATE  18.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	  MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.48824 (using FX rate of 7.74)</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
